   6  0000              ;   Page 0 (#0000..#3FFF mapped at slot 0): TSLib code, ORG #1000
   7  0000              ;   Page 5 (#4000..#7FFF mapped at slot 1): Core code, ORG #6000
   8  0000              ; После Init_Core slot/page mapping: page1=5, page2=2, page3=8.
