 143+ 1020              ; Test functions
 144+ 1020
 145+ 1020              ; The test never passes.
 146+ 1020              FT_NEVER                    EQU 0x00
 147+ 1020              ; Passes if the value is less than the stored value.
 148+ 1020              FT_LESS                     EQU 0x01
 149+ 1020              ; Passes if the value is less than or equal to the stored value.
 150+ 1020              FT_LEQUAL                   EQU 0x02
 151+ 1020              ; Passes if the value is greater than the stored value.
 152+ 1020              FT_GREATER                  EQU 0x03
 153+ 1020              ; Passes if the value is greater than or equal to the stored value
 154+ 1020              FT_GEQUAL                   EQU 0x04
 155+ 1020              ; Passes if the value is equal to the stored value
 156+ 1020              FT_EQUAL                    EQU 0x05
 157+ 1020              ; Passes if the value is not equal to the stored value
 158+ 1020              FT_NOTEQUAL                 EQU 0x06
 159+ 1020              ; The test always passes.
 160+ 1020              FT_ALWAYS                   EQU 0x07
