3463  5FDD              ; VDC_SpeedAdvance — normal-phase chain advance at per-level speed. accum +=
3464  5FDD              ; speed_x100; когда ≥100 → один VDC_MoveChain.
3465  5FDD              ; Core-resident (Main1 почти полон). Clobbers AF, HL.
3466  5FDD              VDC_SpeedAdvance:
