4432  6916              ; Pause "No"/resume fade-out: VDC_DialogState=4 holds the board frozen (not-Play,
4433  6916              ; so frog can't shoot and game time stays frozen) while the pause window fades
4434  6916              ; out over PAUSE_FADE_FRAMES ticks; then -> PLAY. VDC_PauseAlpha (255=opaque)
