  90+ 698E              ; Adventure state vars (CurrentLevel etc) previously lived in TSLib region
  91+ 698E              ; #1937 area where TSLib activity corrupted them. Resident in Core so gameplay,
  92+ 698E              ; menu and level-select code reach them while the loader overlay is unmapped.
  93+ 698E 00           FadeAlpha:         DEFB 0
  94+ 698F 00           CurrentDifficulty: DEFB 0
  95+ 6990 00           CurrentLevel:      DEFB 0
  96+ 6991 00           CurrentSettingIndex: DEFB 0
  97+ 6992 00           CurrentGameMode:   DEFB 0   ; 0=Adventure, 1=Gauntlet
  98+ 6993 00           AdventurePos:      DEFB 0
  99+ 6994 06           VDC_ActiveTrackPage1: DEFB TRACK_L01_PAGE
 100+ 6995 0F           VDC_ActiveTrackPage2: DEFB TRACK_PAGE2
