 572+ C3F8 CD 30 6B                     CALL GS_PlaySfx
 573+ C3FB 3E 01                        LD   A, 1
 574+ C3FD 32 71 D3                     LD   (VDC_RollingActive), A
 575+ C400 C9                           RET
