1019+ C676                              ; --- Level RNG:
1020+ C676                              ; RTC seconds seed only at VDC_Init. Runtime uses deterministic LFSR.
1021+ C676                              ; Per level setting: 50% single random color OR 50% same-color
1022+ C676                              ; chain of random color and random length 1..VDC_NUM_COLORS-1.
