 569+ DD3A 2A 38 E0                       LD   HL, (Frog_TmpB)
 570+ DD3D 7D                             LD   A, L
 570+ DD3E 2F             CPL
 570+ DD3F 6F             LD L, A
 571+ DD40 7C                             LD   A, H
