1730+ F519              ; FT812 frame profiler (diagnostic overlay).
1731+ F519              ; B/W/I are REG_CLOCK delta / 1024. At 60 MHz FT812 clock:
1732+ F519              ;   74 Hz frame ~= 792, 57 Hz frame ~= 1028.
1733+ F519              ; If B+W approaches frame budget and I is near zero, Z80/SPI path misses vblank.
1734+ F519              ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
1735+ F519              ZL_ProfileReadClock:
