 436+ DAB3              LevelSelectDrawBackButton:
 437+ DAB3 CD FC CE                     CALL LevelSelectIsFirstLevel
 438+ DAB6 28 03                        JR   Z, .disabled
 439+ DAB8 C3 AB D5                     JP   LevelSelectDrawBack
 440+ DABB 1E 60        .disabled:      LD   E, 96
 441+ DABD CD 74 13                     CALL FT.Coprocessor.ColorA
