 114+ C43F              ; Backwards-compat aliases (older wrappers below assume per-call swap).
 115+ C43F              ; Now that we call ZiFi_Init/ZiFi_Done at session boundary, these can
 116+ C43F              ; just RET — the slot-0 mapping is already #0F.
 117+ C43F C9           ZiFi_Enter:     RET
 118+ C440 C9           ZiFi_Leave:     RET
