1164+ CC50              ; Read a FAT sector into RawPak_FatBuf (resident in Core / slot 1). Keeps the
1165+ CC50              ; FAT-chain walk from clobbering the slot-2 data buffer (#8000) that callers
1166+ CC50              ; fill with directory/file sectors. HL:DE = LBA on entry.
